---
code: predict-unterminated
when-fires: a check function body is structurally unterminated (missing `;;`/`esac`). oracle/predict.rs lift_failure.
why: the check cannot be lifted. The reason is typed: four PredictUnterminatedReason variants, each with its own prose-component, which the `{reason}` hole renders (28L rul-reason-enums-not-sibling-codes).
owns:
  - predict-unterminated-function-body
---
-- oracle.sh --
# dorc-lang/v0.2
hork__predict() {
   hork --query "$1" >/dev/null 2>&1 : sm.dorc.Package:"$1"@installed

-- replay --
